on the fail-closed `observeOnlyProvider`\n   173\t *  above. Stories 5/6 replace this default with the PI-auth-backed inference\n   174\t *  config. */\n   175\tfunction defaultBuildSdkConfig(): OpResult<SdkConfig> {\n   176\t  return { ok: true, value: { provider: observeOnlyProvider(), mode: \"background\" } };\n   177\t}\n   178\t\n   179\t/** Render the cwd-scoped `--resume` candidates as an operator-facing list, each\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
