tures/corpus.test.ts` | Corpus loader yields valid `MessageEventInput` shapes and lifecycle-coherent sequences | Fixture correctness is test substrate, not product behavior, so no AC covers it |\n   547\t| Concurrency / Lost Update | `inference/closed-loop.test.ts` | A stale background derivation result does not clobber newer thread state | LHC owns this, but the connector's background-mode wiring must not reintroduce it |\n   548\t\n   549\tMigration/compatibility is N/A — POC threads are out of scope (epic Migration), and the package is greenfield. Threshold/budget is N/A — visibility budgets are Epic 2.\n   550\t\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
